OL,3,GNEWSAFounder of Signature empire given
OL,4,Adirector ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe controversial Liverpool businessman
OL,7,Fbehind the collapsed Signature Group of
OL,8,Fproperty firms has been banned as
OL,9,Facting as a company director for five
OL,10,Fyears.
OL,12,FLawrence Kenwright, who once launched
OL,13,Fan unsuccessful bid to become mayor of
OL,14,FLiverpool, was the founder of almost
OL,15,F100 companies which owned a number of
OL,16,Fhotels, including the football themed
OL,17,FShankly and Dixie Dean.
OL,19,FThe Insolvency Service said he had
OL,20,Fallowed one of his companies, Signature
OL,21,FWorks Gold Ltd, to mislead investors -
OL,22,Fwho suffered losses of more than #4.8m.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
